From: adamliaoyifan <adamliaoyifan@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:40:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep cargo masks on accepted YOLO boxes and vectorize
 rectangle refine.

Unaccepted platform/pedestal AABBs were still painted as cargo, which
starved the top-plane fit on whole trials. The refine search is unchanged.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
